			<item>
				<title>Design tokens</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/design-tokens/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/design-tokens/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;All authored colour values in radiance live in &lt;code&gt;assets/css/tokens.css&lt;/code&gt;.&#xA;Every other stylesheet refers to the custom properties defined there, for&#xA;example:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-css&#34; data-lang=&#34;css&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;color&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;radiance&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;accent);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;starting-palette&#34;&gt;Starting palette&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The starting palette takes its cues from Ubuntu&amp;rsquo;s Radiance theme:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Pale panels with fine borders.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A deep aubergine desktop with purple and orange highlights.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;An orange accent for links and selection.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;These are starting values, not a guarantee of accessible contrast; adjust&#xA;them when a combination needs improvement.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
